The Swift streaming implementation follows openWakeWord v0.6.0's feature
windowing, PCM scaling, and mel transform. It uses deterministic live-audio
warmup instead of random initial embeddings. Code is Apache-2.0, see
openWakeWord-LICENSE. Google's speech_embedding backbone is Apache-2.0:
https://tfhub.dev/google/speech_embedding/1

Pretrained Alexa v0.1 is by openWakeWord and is distributed unchanged from
the v0.5.1 release. The upstream pretrained models are licensed under Creative
Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/
See openWakeWord-MODEL-LICENSE. This is a personal-use runtime preview, not
the Hey Evener production classifier. Replace it with the separately trained
Hey Evener artifact and its licensing before any broader distribution.
